<title>USA: IPO PRICING - Digital prices at top of range.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - Digital prices at top of range.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	    Digital Lightwave Inc</p>
<p>   Priced At					 $12</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	     $10 - $12</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			4,600,000</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter		CS First Boston</p>
<p>NOTE: The company raised the number of shares proposed for its planned initial public offering to 4.6 million shares from 4.1 million shares previously.</p>
